        "sectionId": "split-band",
        "values": {
          "eyebrow": "",
          "heading": "",
          "body": "Get your semi-truck back on the road faster by entrusting the Truck Country semi-truck body shop in Shullsburg, Wisconsin. Our shop is conveniently located on highway 11 and can service semi-trucks in the Wisconsin, Iowa and Illinois areas. Our semi-truck body show team is solely focused on your repair and maintenance needs. Our Shullsburg semi-truck body shop specializes in working on Freightliner and Western Star brands and just about any brand of truck! We offer complete and comprehensive services–including body repairs, glass replacement, alignments, and day cab conversions–from a single location. Technicians use the latest in technology such as the state-of-the-art frame straightening machine, Josam Play Detectors and the heated Devilbliss paint booth. From semi-truck body work to complete detailing of all makes and models, it pays to give the team of experts at Shullsburg a call!",
          "image": {
            "src": "https://www.truckcountry.com/efs/wp/domains/www.truckcountry.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/IMG_8686-300x200.jpg",
